// rcTryLettersConfig: ROM_rcTryLettersConfig, used by "Try Letters" in the
// picker of a double-tapped word: recognises letter strings that are in no
// dictionary, with no segmentation.

// the NPR says its inputMask is vLettersAllowed+vNumbersAllowed; the ROM's is letters only
rcTryLettersConfig := {_proto: @rcDefaultConfig, letterSpaceCursiveOption: nil, inputmask: vLettersAllowed};
